PV-Bench is released under the MIT License, reproduced below.

The MIT terms cover this repository except for the following:

  * backend/binary/

    The QCP executables, symexec and StrategyCheck. They are ours but they are
    not open source. They are distributed for running and reproducing this
    benchmark; any other use requires permission from the QCP developers. They
    are fetched from a release rather than stored in git.

  * backend/Rocq/flocq
  * backend/Rocq/compcert_lib
  * backend/Rocq/coq-record-update

    Third-party libraries, vendored on the with-backend branch. Each keeps the
    license it came with; the full text is in that directory.


